&lt;p&gt;The main idea for the fix is to enforce a relation: current rebalance happens before next partition cleaning preventing race between rebalancing and clearing.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;I checked timed out runs and do not see any obvious relation to the patch.&lt;br/&gt;
MVCC PDS3 and PDS4 also time out in base (master) branch.&lt;/p&gt;

